  "translations": [
    {
      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "Snake，能耽误你一下吗？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 32,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "怎么了？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 12,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "听说格林纳达的Gairy总理向联合国提议，设立专门处理UFO问题的机构。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 92,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_REFERENCE_CLIPPED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "格林纳达……加勒比海上的岛国吗。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 48,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "媒体报道中，据说Gairy总理拿来作为UFO存在证据的那些照片里，有一张让我很在意。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 110,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_OMITS_NOTICED_PHOTO"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "这是……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 12,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "啊……就是Huey称作Chrysalis的那件武器。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 52,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "……Kaz，这是我交给Chico的照片。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 44,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "Chico说过，要把它当作UFO照片卖掉……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 50,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "看来这张照片已经被刊登到杂志上了。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 51,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 10,
      "cn_text": "可是……堂堂一国总理，会相信杂志上那些胡扯吗？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 69,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 11,
      "cn_text": "最近整个美洲大陆都流传着很多绑架和牲畜肢解事件的传闻。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 81,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 12,
      "cn_text": "UFO绑架，还有牲畜离奇死亡吗。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 42,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_SEMANTIC_DRIFT_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 13,
      "cn_text": "也许CIA牵涉其中。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 24,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 14,
      "cn_text": "如果真是这样，那个叫Gairy的……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 44,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 15,
      "cn_text": "是啊。要是查得太深，可能会惹上麻烦。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 54,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 16,
      "cn_text": "不过说到格林纳达，它就在古巴近旁。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 51,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 17,
      "cn_text": "从这个角度看，CIA或许也不太容易出手……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 57,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 18,
      "cn_text": "一旦打破国内的权力平衡，也有可能一下子走向共产主义。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 78,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 19,
      "cn_text": "是啊……不过无论如何，这也不是我们能做什么的事。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 72,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 20,
      "cn_text": "我只是觉得至少该告诉你一声。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 42,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 21,
      "cn_text": "明白了。我会注意，别再轻易把照片拿到外面去。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 66,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_OVERSTATES_NO_MORE_PHOTOS"
    }
  ]
